ides</li><li>✓ <!-- -->High-altitude camping</li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-amber-600\">$<!-- -->4,500</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">per person</p></div><button class=\"w-full bg-amber-600 text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-700 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn\">Book Experience<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105\"><div class=\"relative h-56 w-full overflow-hidden bg-gray-200\"><img alt=\"Hot Air Balloon Safari\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/hot-air-balloon.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 bg-white rounded-lg px-3 py-1 shadow-md flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\